### Home
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### Get all employees
GET http://localhost:5000/employees

###

### Get employee by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/employees/1

###

### Add employee
POST http://localhost:5000/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 3,
    "name": "Anita",
    "role": "SRE"
}

###

### Update employee
PUT http://localhost:5000/employees/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Anita",
    "role": "Platform Engineer"
}

###

### Delete employee
DELETE http://localhost:5000/employees/3